"""FZ harness: frozen comparison of the full source-derived spectrum.

Protocol: PROTOCOL.md (SHA-256 in PROTOCOL.sha256), references.json, looks_L0.json (frozen with it).
Reads the current values from RL/work/OM/obstruction_map.json (when it exists), RL/SPECTRUM.md and the lane
result files named in registry.json; writes scoreboard.json and SCOREBOARD.md; keeps the look ledger.

Run (from anywhere):
  /tmp/oph-completion-venv/bin/python -I RL/work/FZ/harness.py
Options: --ledger PATH (default RL/work/FZ/looks_ledger.json), --out-dir DIR (default RL/work/FZ).
Every run that compares a value not compared before adds one look to that row (PROTOCOL.md section 6).
"""
